This is a SolidJS enterprise component library (upthrust-ui) monorepo styled with UnoCSS.

Architecture:
- packages/components — UI layer (JSX + UnoCSS classes)
- packages/competence — Headless behavior (create* composables, no JSX)
- packages/preset — UnoCSS theme preset (tokens, shortcuts, rules)
- example/ — Dev playground with per-component demo pages

Rules:
- Visual design follows Ant Design — never import antd
- All styling via UnoCSS utility classes only
- Components with interactive state must import logic from competence
- Pure layout/style components do NOT need competence
- Every new component/feature requires a demo in example/src/pages/
- Use SolidJS idioms: createSignal, createMemo, splitProps, Show, For
- TypeScript strict, all props interfaces exported
- Use cva (class-variance-authority) for variant composition
- Use twMerge (tailwind-merge) for class deduplication

See AGENTS.md for full specification.
